  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU support to strengthen return management systems in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to contribute to the effective operationalisation of return systems in the Western Balkans and strengthen institutional capacities to lead rights-based return management, in line with international and EU standards. The project will work towards achieving this by enhancing return, readmission, and reintegration cooperation among the WB and CoO, strengthening institutional systems and capacities for rights-based return management, and increasing access to return and reintegration information and assistance for migrants in the Western Balkans before and after return.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
